{"description":"Meet Our Team – Al Nahda Cyberstorm 🚀\n\nWe are the Al Nahda Cyberstorm team! We are a group of creative and curious students who worked together to explore NASA's space equipment and amazing discoveries. Each team member contributed ideas, research, and creativity to make this project special. Our goal is to make learning about space fun, interesting, and interactive for everyone. Together, we are ready to explore beyond the stars!","image":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_6.44..2e16d0ba.fill-300x250.jpg","members":[{"name":"sarah yousif qaddoura","country":"United Arab Emirates","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/IMG-20260915-WA0000_fEz3Vhq.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":true},{"name":"Amna Jassm al zaabi","country":"United Arab Emirates","avatar":null,"owner":false},{"name":"MARAH MOHAMMAD AHMAD JARAH","country":"United Arab Emirates","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/IMG_6655_76dnmC6.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"Mariam  jaber aljasme","country":"United Arab Emirates","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/IMG_0485_dpAlwJV.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"Nahla issam ismat shadid","country":"United Arab Emirates","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/331.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"LAYAN AHMED HAMDI ABDELHAMID ZAGHLOUL","country":"United Arab Emirates","avatar":null,"owner":false}]}